  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You poke faster than the eye can move.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Assassin techniques class feature, acupressure as a chosen assassin specialization, know at least three acupressure techniques</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Three times per day, whenever you would execute an acupressure technique in place of an attack in a full-attack action, you may instead execute that technique at the end of your full-attack action without sacrificing an attack to do so. Its attack bonus is equal to that of your last main-hand attack in a full-attack action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/assassin-feats#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
